  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`RECORD_TEMPLATES` has exactly six entries (Project, Matter, Work assignment, Invoice, Service request, Document) whose left, right and toolbar lists equal the spec FR-01 table; a test asserts it.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Every entity in `RECORD_LINK_TOKENS` and `FEED_RECORD_TYPES` has a template entry (deep links and notification links resolve to a config).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a ready record, the title is "{label} {number}"; with no number it is "{label} {name}", then "{label}".</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Loading, denied, notfound, error (with Try again only when retryable) and deleted each render; in denied no field and no section is in the DOM.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Toolbar, header and tabs are outside the scrolling content element; the content element carries the thin-scrollbar class.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">With no `tabs` in a config no TabList renders; with a test config that has two tabs, the TabList renders and switches content.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Refresh re-reads the record; Copy link writes `?record={token}:{id}` for the shown record to the clipboard; a clipboard failure shows an inline message, not an exception.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Toolbar actions other than Refresh and Copy link are not rendered (hidden, not disabled).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">While `holdNavigation` is true, `onBeforeNavigate` returns false and Close does not close; when false both work.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`tests/RecordDetailModal.test.tsx` still passes after the reads move; RecordOpener still opens the R3 modal.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">typecheck, lint and the vitest suite pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test scope: cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named above. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Spec FR-01, FR-02, NFR-01, NFR-03. Anchors verified 2026-11-10: SprkModal `size="lg"` at `RecordDetailModal.tsx:617`, `onBeforeNavigate` :622, reads :86-227, `RECORD_DETAIL_ENTITIES` `RecordDetailFields.tsx:73`, `RECORD_LINK_TOKENS` `record-targets.ts:35`, `thinScrollbarStyle` `theme/scrollbar.ts:32`. SprkModal's body is the `overflowY: auto` region (`SprkModal.tsx:109-117`): make the template root fill it (height 100%) so the body never scrolls and the inner content region does. Width tests at 1440/1000/375 are ui-tests (jsdom has no layout). External SPA tests run under vitest (`npm test` = `vitest run`).</notes>

